 "final_summary": "The bug was caused by the boolean parsing function not converting input strings to lowercase before comparison. The fix adds a lowercase conversion to the input string in tracker/convert.py, making boolean values case-insensitive. This ensures inputs like 'TRUE' or 'true' are correctly interpreted as True, fixing the regression.",
